{"id":"1946c1e666e6036a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-mean-curvature.md","title":"Mean Curvature Flow","display":"df-mean-curvature — Mean Curvature Flow","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mean-curvature","aliases":["58-df-mean-curvature"],"display":"df-mean-curvature — Mean Curvature Flow","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mean-curvature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mean-curvature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mean-curvature — Mean Curvature Flow"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99574bf9a84bc839\" href=\"?note=99574bf9a84bc839\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md\">../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"907cbbf21e362abd\" href=\"?note=907cbbf21e362abd\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md\">../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M,\\tau_M,F,I\\in V\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M,\\tau_M,F,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_t(p)=F(p,t)\">\\(F_t(p)=F(p,t)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99574bf9a84bc839\" href=\"?note=99574bf9a84bc839\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md\">../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99574bf9a84bc839\" href=\"?note=99574bf9a84bc839\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md\">../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"907cbbf21e362abd\" href=\"?note=907cbbf21e362abd\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md\">../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,I,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;(a\\leq s\\land s\\leq b\\to s\\in I)\\land F\\in C^\\infty(M\\times I,\\mathbb R^{n+1})\\land\\exists\\nu:M\\times I\\to S^n\\;\\exists H:M\\times I\\to\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;\\left(F_t\\in\\operatorname{Emb}^{\\infty}(M,\\mathbb R^{n+1})\\land\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S(F_t[M],\\mathbb R^{n+1},n+1)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S(\\nu(p,t),F_t(p),F_t[M])\\land H(p,t)=\\operatorname{tr}\\!\\left(-d\\nu_t|_p\\circ(dF_t|_p)^{-1}\\right)\\land\\partial_tF(p,t)=-H(p,t)\\nu(p,t)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,I,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\\land\\varnothing\\neq I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R\\;(a\\leq s\\land s\\leq b\\to s\\in I)\\land F\\in C^\\infty(M\\times I,\\mathbb R^{n+1})\\land\\exists\\nu:M\\times I\\to S^n\\;\\exists H:M\\times I\\to\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;\\left(F_t\\in\\operatorname{Emb}^{\\infty}(M,\\mathbb R^{n+1})\\land\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S(F_t[M],\\mathbb R^{n+1},n+1)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S(\\nu(p,t),F_t(p),F_t[M])\\land H(p,t)=\\operatorname{tr}\\!\\left(-d\\nu_t|_p\\circ(dF_t|_p)^{-1}\\right)\\land\\partial_tF(p,t)=-H(p,t)\\nu(p,t)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,I,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,I,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,I,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,I,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Huisken (1986): convex surfaces become round under MCF.</li>\n<li>Gage–Hamilton (1986): planar curves become convex and shrink.</li>\n<li>Mean curvature flow develops singularities (neck pinch in higher codim).</li>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> is the trace of the shape operator (the sum, not the average, of the principal curvatures).</li>\n<li>The four-argument compatibility form existentially binds the manifold topology and delegates to the explicit five-argument predicate.</li>\n<li>Brakke (1978): varifold solution for non-smooth flows.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md","status":"resolved","id":"99574bf9a84bc839","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md","status":"resolved","id":"907cbbf21e362abd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md","status":"resolved","id":"99574bf9a84bc839","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md","status":"resolved","id":"99574bf9a84bc839","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md","status":"resolved","id":"907cbbf21e362abd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UnitNormal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-unit-normal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land M,\\tau_M,F,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F_t(p)=F(p,t)","di